## Java 코드

```java
public class Main {
    public static int num = 5;

    public static void g() {
        System.out.print(num + " ");
    }

    public static void f() {
        int num = 9;
        while(num < 8)
            num++;
        System.out.print(num + " ");
        g();
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        f();

        System.out.print(num);
    }
}

```

## JavaScript 코드

```JavaScript
let num = 5;

function g() {
    process.stdout.write(num + " ");
}

function f() {
    let num = 9;

    while (num < 8) {
        num += 1;
    }
    process.stdout.write(num + " ");

    g();
}

f();

process.stdout.write(num + " ");
```

